        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "{\n  \"analysis\": \"The advisor confirmed that pos0 success is misleading because attention is trivial with one token (weight=1.0, output=V). The bug lives in the attention/c_proj path or weight orientation. The exploding hidden norm (27 by layer 2 at pos0) is a red flag suggesting the MLP or attention projection may be amplifying incorrectly. I need test transposing individual weight matrices and check for variable name strings in the checkpoint.\",\n  \"plan\": \"Run a Python script that tests transposing each weight matrix individually (c_attn only, c_proj only, c_fc only, c_proj_mlp only) to see which combination fixes the norm explosion and produces coherent pos1 output. Also search for variable name strings in the checkpoint.\",\n  \"commands\": [\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"strings /app/gpt2-124M.ckpt | grep -iE 'h0|ln|c_attn|wte|wpe' | head -20 || echo \\\"no strings found\\\"\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.1\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport struct,math\\nV,H,N,L,C,M,A,D=50257,768,1024,12,2304,3072,12,64\\nBS=7087872;P=C+H*C+H+H*H\\nf=open('/app/gpt2-124M.ckpt','rb')\\ndef Fa(o,n):\\n f.seek(o*4);return list(struct.unpack('<%df'%n,f.read(n*4)))\\ndef ln(x,g,b):\\n m=sum(x)/H;v=sum((xi-m)**2 for xi in x)/H;iv=1/math.sqrt(v+1e-5)\\n return[(xi-m)*iv*gi+bi for xi,gi,bi in zip(x,g,b)]\\ndef ge(x):return .5*x*(1+math.tanh(.7978845608*(x+.044715*x**3)))\\ndef li(x,w,b,inn,out):\\n y=b[:]\\n for i in range(inn):\\n  xi=x[i];base=i*out\\n  for j in range(out):y[j]+=xi*w[base+j]\\n return y\\ndef li_t(x,w,b,inn,out):\\n y=b[:]\\n for j in range(out):\\n  base=j*inn;s=0\\n  for i in range(inn):s+=x[i]*w[base+i]\\n  y[j]+=s\\n return y\\nwte_all=Fa(85842432,V*H)\\ndef top3_and_norm(x,debug_norm=False):\\n lf=ln(x,Fa(85055232,H),Fa(85054464,H))\\n best=[]\\n for j in range(V):\\n  base=j*H;s=sum(lf[i]*wte_all[base+i] for i in range(H))\\n  if len(best)<3 or s>best[0][0]:best.append((s,j));best=sorted(best,key=lambda t:t[0]);best=best[-3:]\\n return [(j,round(s,2)) for s,j in reversed(best)]\\ndef test_transpose(t_attn,t_proj,t_fc,t_proj_mlp):\\n kc=[[None]*N for _ in range(L)]\\n vc=[[None]*N for _ in range(L)]\\n def fwd(tok,pos):\\n  x=[a+b for a,b in zip(Fa(85842432+tok*H,H),Fa(85056000+pos*H,H))]\\n  for l in range(L):\\n   o=l*BS\\n   lx=ln(x,Fa(o+P+H,H),Fa(o+P,H))\\n   q=(li_t if t_attn else li)(lx,Fa(o+C,H*C),Fa(o,C),H,C)\\n   kc[l][pos]=q[H:2*H];vc[l][pos]=q[2*H:3*H]\\n   ao=[0]*H\\n   for h in range(A):\\n    qq=q[h*D:(h+1)*D];sc=[]\\n    for j in range(pos+1):\\n     k=kc[l][j][h*D:(h+1)*D];s=sum(qq[d]*k[d] for d in range(D))/8;sc.append(s)\\n    mx=max(sc);sm=sum(math.exp(s-mx) for s in sc);oo=[0]*D\\n    for j in range(pos+1):\\n     v=vc[l][j][h*D:(h+1)*D];w=math.exp(sc[j]-mx)/sm\\n     for d in range(D):oo[d]+=w*v[d]\\n    for d in range(D):ao[h*D+d]=oo[d]\\n   h2=(li_t if t_proj else li)(ao,Fa(o+C+H*C+H,H*H),Fa(o+C+H*C,H),H,H)\\n   x=[x[i]+h2[i] for i in range(H)]\\n   lx=ln(x,Fa(o+P+3*H,H),Fa(o+P+2*H,H))\\n   h1=[ge(v) for v in (li_t if t_fc else li)(lx,Fa(o+P+4*H+M,H*M),Fa(o+P+4*H,M),H,M)]\\n   h2=(li_t if t_proj_mlp else li)(h1,Fa(o+P+4*H+M+H*M+H,M*H),Fa(o+P+4*H+M+H*M,H),M,H)\\n   x=[x[i]+h2[i] for i in range(H)]\\n   if l==0 and pos==0:\\n    n0=math.sqrt(sum(xi**2 for xi in x)/H)\\n   if l==1 and pos==0:\\n    n1=math.sqrt(sum(xi**2 for xi in x)/H)\\n  return top3_and_norm(x),n0,n1\\n r0,n0,n1=fwd(15496,0)\\n r1,_,_=fwd(11,1)\\n return r0,r1,n0,n1\\ntests=[\\n ('none',False,False,False,False),\\n ('attn',True,False,False,False),\\n ('proj',False,True,False,False),\\n ('fc',False,False,True,False),\\n ('proj_mlp',False,False,False,True),\\n ('attn+proj',True,True,False,False),\\n ('fc+proj_mlp',False,False,True,True),\\n ('all',True,True,True,True),\\n]\\nfor name,ta,tp,tf,tm in tests:\\n r0,r1,n0,n1=test_transpose(ta,tp,tf,tm)\\n print(f'{name}: pos0={r0} pos1={r1} n0={n0:.2f} n1={n1:.2f}')\\nPY\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 60.0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"task_complete\": false\n}",
